g of PNG files is required, we preserve the alpha channel and offer direct links that hot-load the original transparent file, allowing it to be used as a logo, icons or overlay.\\n\\n### 6. Can I crop or trim whitespace while uploading in bulk?\\n\\nUse the \\\"smart crop\\\" checkbox. We will have an option of bulk image crop, which will automatically mark the major ones and delete any unnecessary edges, or you can specify the pixel coordinates, which will result in the same image being cropped on all or all of the images in the batch.\\n\\n### 7. How long are the free links valid?\\n\\nFree links are permanent by default. You can delete them whenever you please, or even provide an expiry date (1 day, 7 days, 30 days) at the uploader.\\n\\n### 8. Is there a size or bandwidth limit on the free plan?\\n\\nNo, there is no size or bandwidth limit on the free plan. If you sign up on our website, you get access to manage all your uploads and get access to the dashboard that will help you keep track of all the data.\\n\\n### 9. Can I export the results as a CSV or JSON list?\\n\\nWhen you are done with the batch, choose Export and CSV or JSON or Markdown table - the first one will be the best when the developers work with the URLs directly into the AI pipelines or CMS imports.\\n\\n### 10. Do you support WebP and AVIF conversion?\\n\\nYes. The auto-next-gen feature is on, and all JPGs/PNGs are converted to WebP (or AVIF to be also compatible with browsers), yet the PNG link remains a backup.\",\"readingTime\":{\"text\":\"9 min read\",\"minutes\":9,\"words\":1722},\"headings\":[{\"id\":\"what-is-bulk-image-uploading\",\"title\":\"What is Bulk Image Uploading?\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"key-features-of-modern-bulk-image-uploaders\",\"title\":\"Key Features of Modern Bulk Image Uploaders\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"how-to-bulk-upload-images-step-by-step-guide\",\"title\":\"How to Bulk Upload Images: Step-by-Step Guide\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"step-1-access-the-bulk-upload-tool\",